LESSON|0|Maxilani's turn.|Electric Touch's own power is 0. This raw power number is shown in yellow at the top-right of its attack menu button before any stats are added. Add Maxilani's Strength, then subtract Angler's Defense (1 - 3 = -2, but a hit always deals at least 1), and this attack would deal 1 damage if it hit.
