LESSON|1|Musashi's turn.|The yellow line above your stats shows Precise Tap and 0: the damage it will actually deal to Angler. Everything is already factored in - the move's power, Musashi's STR and Angler's DEF - so you don't have to work it out yourself. It appears whenever you hover over a target.
