LESSON|2|Bucky's turn.|If the enemy's Evasion (EVA, right panel) is greater than or equal to the attacker's Accuracy (ACC, left panel), the enemy evades and the attack misses. Here Bucky's Accuracy is 1 and Angler's Evasion is 2, so this attack will miss, shown by MISS in the middle. Each dodge spends the enemy's Evasion down by the Accuracy it beat, and it only refills at the start of that enemy's own next turn.
